<title>USA: Alliant Techsystems gets $31.6 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Alliant Techsystems gets $31.6 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliant Techsystems Inc said Wednesday its Defense Systems Group has been awarded a $31.6 million contract from GenCorp's GenCorp Aerojet unit to produce 600 rounds of Sense and Destroy Armor (SADARM) smart artillery munition.</p>
<p>The low-rate initial production contract, which currently runs through December 1998, contains options that could extend production through October 1999.</p>
<p>Alliant Techsystems' Defense Systems Group reported fiscal year 1996 sales of $437 million.</p>
<p>GenCorp Aerojet develops propulsion, electronic systems, smart munitions, armaments, and custom chemicals.</p>
<p>		 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
